# Diagnostic output at the repository root.
#
# Seven console dumps - grep output, a pgTAP transcript, a stray SQL snippet -
# were committed here and sat in the tree for weeks. Nothing referenced them and
# nothing could: they were the residue of debugging sessions. Scoped to the root
# and to these two shapes deliberately, so a real document is never hidden by a
# rule meant for scratch output.
/*.log
/*-debug.txt
